Z||000003||theogre||10-13-2001||03:35 PM||||B&M doesn't make parts for TH125 that's in Fiero.<P>Just about any TH125 part you want, including TransGo shift kits, can be found thru these guys... <A HREF="http://www.txchange.com/" TARGET=_blank>Transmission Exchange Co.</A> They also carry a TC lockup delay set that can help the earlier models.<P>------------------<BR>  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/fullstaff.gif">  <FONT COLOR="blue"><I><B>11-Sept-01, The day the world as we knew it ended.</B></I></FONT>||||reg||1
